{"results":[{"url":"https://www.wral.com/archive/18995597/","final_url":"https://www.wral.com/archive/18995597/","title":"Did Sanders oppose 'Obamacare'?","description":"Former Vice President Joe Biden said U.S. Sen. Bernie Sanders talks in a way that one would think Sanders and Barack Obama \"were close buddies.\" But they were not, Biden said, claiming that Sanders was against Obama's signature health care law.","language":"en","text":"# Did Sanders oppose 'Obamacare'?\n\nFormer Vice President Joe Biden said U.S. Sen. Bernie Sanders talks in a way that one would think Sanders and Barack Obama \"were close buddies.\" But they were not, Biden said, claiming that Sanders was against Obama's signature health care law.\n\nPosted\n3/6/2020, 1:55:25 AM\n\nCORONAVIRUS, ANSWERING THE\n\nTHREE MOST FREQUENTLY ASKED\n\nQUESTIONS FROM THE POST.\n\n>>> WELL, ELIZABETH WARREN IS\n\nDROPPING OUT OF THE RACE TODAY.\n\nTHE DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE RACE\n\nIS DOWN TO JOE BIDEN AND BERNIE\n\nSANDERS.\n\nNOW MORE ON BIDEN'S CLAIMS WITH\n\nCULLEN BROWDER.\n\n>> JOE BIDEN IS KNOWN AS BARACK\n\nOBAMA'S VICE PRESIDENT.\n\nNOW THAT HE IS RUNNING FOR\n\nPRESIDENT HE IS CALLING OUT\n\nCANDIDATES THAT CROSSED OBAMA\n\nAND RECENTLY SAID THIS ABOUT\n\nBERNIE SANDERS.\n\n>> HE WAS AS OPPOSED TO OH.\n\nDIDN'T LIKE THE FACT WE DIDN'T\n\nPUSH A SINGLE PAYER OPTION\n\n>> LOOK AT THIS VIDEO FROM DAYS\n\nBEFORE THE SENATE VOTED ON OKAY\n\n>> I AM GOING TO DO MY BEST TO\n\nMAKE THIS BILL A BETTER BILL,\n\nTHAT I INDICATED TO THE WHITE\n\nHOUSE AND DEMOCRATIC\n\nRELATIONSHIP THAT MY VOTE IS\n\nNOT SECURE AT THIS POINT.\n\n>> HOW DID IT END?\n\nSANDERS ULTIMATELY DID VOTE FOR\n\nOKAY OH SO IT IS UNFAIR FOR\n\nTHE OPPOSING OF IT BY SANDERS.\n\n© WRAL","author":"WRAL News","published_date":"2020-03-06T01:55:25Z","latency_ms":1500.8350930002052,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}